片受体激动剂（外周限制性）","quote_sha256":"d9986bc9f336f8af3610fd90427ab533d5859f7e3d8f9e0f570716023f0aeeec","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"ES002"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_6d9208d7233030ca:full-draft:e5879fdd033db011535263ee","quote":"章节标题=研究药物简介\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=KRX-203片","quote_sha256":"a405b6e50869cd10221bef9e7e7d592bf5afedf53794fe05d8645afab4a4ee58","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:e5879fdd033db011535263ee","span_id":"ES007"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES002","ES007"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充KRX-203研究者手册或等效非临床/既往临床资料","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-002","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床药理学与毒理学资料","既往临床数据"],"target":"研究药物简介正文（作用机制详述、非临床摘要、既往临床数据）"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床药理学与毒理学资料","既往临床数据","药物化学结构信息"],"proposal_text":"KRX-203片为申办方提供的口服固体制剂（薄膜衣片），规格为0.25mg和0.5mg（以游离碱计），给药途径为口服，属小分子药物，系统暴露范围为全身性。其作用机制类别为κ阿片受体激动剂（外周限制性）。本研究设0.25mg每日两次和0.5mg每日两次两个剂量组，每次1片，随餐或空腹服用，疗程8周，无负荷剂量。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的药物技术类型、剂型、规格、给药途径、作用机制类别及剂量方案撰写。研究药物简介章节通常还需包含药物化学结构、作用机制详细阐述、非临床药理学与毒理学摘要、既往临床数据及安全性特征等内容，当前缺少研究者手册及非临床/既往临床资料，无法进一步展开。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_db36697d1665ba50","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:e5879fdd033db011535263ee","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_2026101